        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Pinball Hall of Fame: The Gottlieb Collection is a pinball video game developed by FarSight Studios and published by Crave Entertainment. The tables in the game are recreations of real tables. The game was later released as Gottlieb Pinball Classics, published by System 3, in Europe and Australia. This expanded version featured additional tables and was released in North America on Wii and PSP under the original name, Pinball Hall of Fame: The Gottlieb Collection.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Pinball Hall of Fame: The Gottlieb Collection es un videojuego de pinball desarrollado por FarSight Studios y publicado por Crave Entertainment. Las mesas del juego son recreaciones de mesas reales. Más tarde, el juego se lanzó como Gottlieb Pinball Classics, publicado por System 3, en Europa y Australia. Esta versión ampliada incluía mesas adicionales y se lanzó en Norteamérica para Wii y PSP con el nombre original, Pinball Hall of Fame: The Gottlieb Collection.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
